{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"2013.2.20 0:00\n17歳になりましたー！\nせべんてーん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/20/8600581/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/20/8600581/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/20/8600581/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/20/8600581/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/20/8600581/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/20/8600581/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/20/8600581/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/20/8600581/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"16歳は今まで生きてきて\nいちばん濃かった一年間でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年の今頃と比べたら変わったな。\nたくさんの人に支えられて\nここまで成長することができました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感謝の気持ちでいっぱいです。\n乃木坂familyのみなさんが\nだいすきです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"17歳は、もっともっともーーっと\n濃い一年になったらいいな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"17歳ってさ。\nよく言う「永遠の17歳」\nとかあるじゃない？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっと17歳が大人と子どもの境目。\nいちばん青春できるときだ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チャンス"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/20/8600581/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂のメンバーとしてもっと\nお仕事を充実させたい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大人になって\n「17歳は充実してたなあー\n楽しかったなあー」\nって思えたらいいな"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/20/8600581/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"忘れられない素敵な一年間に\nなれますように。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色気ほしいとか言いません笑\n私らしくがいちばんだわね。←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもありがとうございます。\nこれからもよろしくお願いします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログ更新頑張ろ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ピチピチの17歳\n伊藤万理華より"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2013/02/20/8600581/0000.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}